
# 🛡️ AI-Based Smart Air Base Perimeter Security System

An educational **IoT + AI-based perimeter monitoring and intrusion-alert prototype** designed to demonstrate how smart sensors, cameras, edge devices, and a web dashboard can work together to monitor a restricted-area perimeter.

> ⚠️ **Disclaimer:** This project is intended strictly for academic, research, and educational purposes. It is a non-operational monitoring and alert system. It does not provide weapon control, targeting, interception, jamming, or offensive military capabilities.

---

## 📌 Project Overview

Traditional perimeter security systems often depend on manual monitoring and isolated sensors. This project demonstrates a centralized smart monitoring architecture where multiple IoT sensor nodes continuously collect environmental and motion data.

When suspicious movement is detected, the system can:

* Detect motion near monitored zones
* Collect sensor data through ESP32
* Capture an image using a camera module
* Analyze events using an AI-based classification model
* Send data to a central server
* Display real-time security status on a web dashboard
* Generate alerts for authorized security personnel

