## 🔹 2. Camera-Based Verification

When a sensor detects unusual activity, the camera module can capture an image for event verification.

Example:

```text
Motion Detected
      ↓
Camera Triggered
      ↓
Image Captured
      ↓
AI Verification
```

---

## 🔹 3. AI-Based Event Classification

The AI module can classify detected events into categories such as:

```text
NORMAL
ANIMAL
PERSON
UNKNOWN
```

Example:

```text
Detection Result

Object: Person
Confidence: 91%
Zone: Zone-03
Status: HIGH PRIORITY
```

> AI classification should be treated as decision support and not as a guaranteed identification system.

---

## 🔹 4. Multi-Sensor Verification

Instead of relying on a single sensor:

```text
PIR + IR + Camera
       ↓
Event Verification
       ↓
Alert
```

This approach can help reduce false positives.

