# 📡 IoT Communication

The ESP32 can communicate with the backend using either:

### HTTP

```text
ESP32
  ↓
HTTP POST
  ↓
Express API
  ↓
MongoDB
```

### MQTT

```text
ESP32
  ↓
MQTT Broker
  ↓
Backend
  ↓
MongoDB
```

MQTT is useful when many sensor nodes need lightweight messaging.

